# Plugins and agent tools

- Extend `plugins/` modules; match existing tool registration patterns in `agent/agent.py`.
- Side-effecting tools must require explicit user confirmation (two-step for Jira writes).
- Keep tool outputs short and structured; avoid returning huge HTML/JSON blobs to the LLM.
- Playwright: headed by default for this product; evidence/screenshots belong with the runner/reports.
- Add a focused unit/integration test when changing core tool behaviour.
